       Acu-Screen1-Create-Win.
      *    Before-Create
      * display screen
              DISPLAY Standard GRAPHICAL WINDOW
                 LINES 16.00, SIZE 36.00, CELL HEIGHT 10, 
                 CELL WIDTH 10, AUTO-MINIMIZE, COLOR IS 65793, 
                 LABEL-OFFSET 0, LINK TO THREAD, MODELESS, NO SCROLL, 
                 WITH SYSTEM MENU, 
