      * Screen1
       Acu-Screen1-Proc.
           PERFORM UNTIL Exit-Pushed
              ACCEPT Screen1  
                 ON EXCEPTION PERFORM Acu-Screen1-Evaluate-Func
              END-ACCEPT
           END-PERFORM
           DESTROY Screen1-Handle
           INITIALIZE Key-Status
           .
      * Screen2
       Acu-Screen2-Proc.
           PERFORM UNTIL Exit-Pushed
