                 END-IF
      * Screen2-Pb-1 Link To
              WHEN Key-Status = 1000
                 PERFORM Acu-Screen2-Exit
           END-EVALUATE
           MOVE 1 TO Accept-Control
           .

       Acu-Screen1-Exit.
